From: jason-liu-4980 <38558962+jason-liu-4980@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 06:09:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] arm64: sprd: consolidate SY108 DT and GPIO/hwspinlock
 fallbacks

Keep seven SoC, PMIC, board, pinctrl, firmware and profile files.
Use symbolic references and remove unused board frontends. Match GPIO
and hwspinlock through upstream-compatible fallbacks, restoring both
driver C files exactly to v7.3 without changing resources or consumers.
